  "name": "build-perf-diagnostics",
  "description": "Diagnose MSBuild bottlenecks from binlog timelines and Target/Task Performance Summaries after baseline measurements. USE FOR: unknown build slowness, RAR >5s, analyzers >30% of Csc, a target >50% of build, node utilization below 80%, excessive Copy, restore overhead. DO NOT USE FOR: within-build duplicates (find-repeated-work-within-one-build), known repeated restores (eliminate-redundant-restores), initial baselines (build-perf-baseline), incremental rebuilds (incremental-build), parallelism tuning (build-parallelism), non-MSBuild builds.",
